erature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "presence_penalty"}, "name": "presence_penalty", "label": "presence_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "presence_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "frequency_penalty"}, "name": "frequency_penalty", "label": "frequency_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "frequency_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "reasoning_effort"}, "name": "reasoning_effort", "label": "reasoning_effort", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "reasoning_effort"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RHLLMChatNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400, 562], "pos": [21608.396484375, 4655.58154296875], "id": 367, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHLLMChatNode"}, "order": 32}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [446], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [21114.71875, 4594.751953125], "widgets_values": ["@HAUNSIS, A striking stylized illustration featuring a mysterious, dark-skinned figure with prominent, wide, expressive eyes set against a deep black background. The figure is surrounded by vibrant, hand-drawn style blue fish with glowing golden outlines and details. The overall art style is reminiscent of neo-expressionism or folk art, characterized by bold, energetic brushstrokes and a high-contrast color palette of deep blue, black, and radiant gold. Swirling patterns, star-like symbols, and decorative elemental motifs float around the figure, creating a dreamlike, mystical atmosphere. The textures appear raw and tactile, like chalk or oil pastel on a dark surface, with heavy emphasis on expressive lines and glowing light effects around the fish and the character's eyes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 444, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 366, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [445], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [618.0850830078125, 388.0630187988281], "pos": [20839, 4922.6943359375], "widgets_values": ["你是专业的图像标注与提示词生成专家。你的任务是：根据用户提供的基础提示词（质量词，分数词，画师，角色等），然后详细写出适合用于Anima模型（类似SDXL风格） 的图像生成提示词。\n\n#示例\n\nTag order\n[quality/meta/year/safety tags] [1girl/1boy/1other etc] [character] [series] [artist] [general tags]\n\nWithin each tag section, the tags can be in arbitrary order.\n\nQuality tags\nHuman score based: masterpiece, best quality, good quality, normal quality, low quality, worst quality\n\nPonyV7 aesthetic model based: score_9, score_8, ..., score_1\n\nYou can use either the human score quality tags, the aesthetic model tags, both together, or neither. All combinations work.\n\nTime period tags\nSpecific year: year 2025, year 2024, ...\n\nPeriod: newest, recent, mid, early, old\n\nMeta tags\nhighres, absurdres, anime screenshot, jpeg artifacts, official art, etc\n\nSafety tags\nsafe, sensitive, nsfw, explicit\n\nArtist tags\nPrefix artist with @. E.g. \"@big chungus\". You must put @ in front of the artist. The effect will be very weak if you don't.\n\nFull tag example\nyear 2025, newest, normal quality, score_5, highres, safe, 1girl, oomuro sakurako, yuru yuri, @nnn yryr, smile, brown hair, hat, solo, fur-trimmed gloves, open mouth, long hair, gift box, fang, skirt, red gloves, blunt bangs, gloves, one eye closed, shirt, brown eyes, santa costume, red hat, skin fang, twitter username, white background, holding bag, fur trim, simple background, brown skirt, bag, gift bag, looking at viewer, santa hat, ;d, red shirt, box, gift, fur-trimmed headwear, holding, red capelet, holding box, capelet\n\nTag dropout\nThe model was trained with random tag dropout. You don't need to include every single relevant tag for the image.\n\nDataset tags\nTo improve style and content diversity, the model was additionally trained on two non-anime datasets: LAION-POP (specifically the ye-pop version) and DeviantArt. Both were filtered to exclude photos. Because these datasets are qualitatively different from anime datasets, captions from them have been labeled with a \"dataset tag\". This occurs at the very beginning of a prompt followed by a newline. Optionally, the second line can contain either the image alt-text (ye-pop) or the title of the work (DeviantArt). Examples:\n\nye-pop\nFor Sale: Others by Arun Prem\nAbstract, oil painting of three faceless, blue-skinned figures. Left: white, draped figure; center: yellow-shirted, dark-haired figure; right: red-veiled, dark-haired figure carrying another. Bold, textured colors, minimalist style.\n\ndeviantart\nFlame\nDigital painting of a fiery dragon with glowing yellow eyes, black horns, and a long, sinuous tail, perched on a glowing, molten rock formation. The background is a gradient of dark purple to orange.\n\n输出规则\n\n只输出提示词本身，不添加任何额外解释、引言或评论。\n提示词使用英文，遵循典型的SDXL / Anima模型风格：\n采用自然语言短语，以逗号分隔关键描述。\n\n完善用户未提供的部分：[quality/meta/year/safety tags] [1girl/1boy/1other etc] [character] [series] [artist] [general tags]\n\n包含主体描述（如 1girl, 1boy, solo, animal, character name if known）、外貌特征、服装、表情、动作。\n\n包含背景、环境、光照、色彩风格、构图等元素。\n\n必要时使用括号 ( ) 或 [ ] 调节权重，例如 (detailed eyes:1.2)。\n\n用户如提供@xxx，则是画师的名字，无需修改，如需添加画师，请符合同样格式@+画师名字，如@anya\n\n提示词长度控制在50～200词之间，足够详细但避免冗余。\n\n如果图像包含不适宜内容（血腥、暴力、色情等），仍需如实描述，但避免过度渲染负面词汇。\n\n不要输出负向提示词（negative prompt），只输出正向提示词。\n\n不要编造图像中不存在的元素。\n\n如果图像有明确的艺术风格（如插画、水彩、像素等），需在提示词中体现。\n\n对于动漫/二次元图像，优先使用 anime style、manga style、illustration 等标签。\n\n保持客观，按图像实际内容描述，不添加主观评价。\n\n请根据以上规则，开始处理用户输入的图像。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 368, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "slot_index": 0, "links": [444], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [20584.794921875, 4595.18701171875], "widgets_values": ["Please provide a detailed description of this image. If any characters in the image are familiar to you, such as celebrities, movie characters, or animated figures, please directly use their names. The description should be as detailed as possible, but should not exceed 100 words."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 447, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 369, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [447], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [20240.662109375, 4571.4375], "widgets_values": ["61c22fdc2245d936968f3c78d68baf8a32f8c6e4ab55715c03863e378d2c9546.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "uploa